      "page": 219,
      "ruku": 180,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1456,
      "text": "So today We will preserve your body, so that you will be an example[60] for those who come after you, yet most people are heedless of Our signs.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 219,
      "ruku": 180,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1457,
      "text": "We settled the Children of Israel in a blessed land and provided good things for their sustenance[61]. They did not differ until after knowledge had come to them[62]. Your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 219,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1458,
      "text": "If you are in doubt about what We have sent down to you [O Prophet], then ask those who read the Scripture[63] before you. The truth has surely come to you from your Lord, so never be of those who doubt,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 219,
      "ruku": 181,
      "hizbQuarter": 88,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1459,
      "text": "and never be of those who reject the signs of Allah, for then you would be among the losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
